Package: foxssh
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: default-jre | java11-runtime, iproute2, policykit-1 | polkitd, systemd
Recommends: systemd-resolved | libnss-resolve, python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: Fox SSH <noreply@example.com>
Description: Fox SSH - system-wide SSH tunnel VPN client
 SSH tunnel (password auth) with tun2socks, badvpn-udpgw UDP support,
 server banner popup and an Iran IP bypass list (direct, uncounted traffic).
